@baseUrl = http://localhost:5004/api
@accessToken = PASTE_FRESH_TOKEN_HERE

### Get videos by channel
GET {{baseUrl}}/channels/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/videos?page=1&pageSize=20

### Get subscriptions feed (requires the caller to actually be subscribed to something in UserService)
GET {{baseUrl}}/videos/subscriptions?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Upload video (creates Draft record — call BEFORE uploading raw file to MediaService)
POST {{baseUrl}}/videos/upload
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "title": "My First Video",
  "description": "A short description of the video.",
  "tags": ["tech", "tutorial", "dotnet"]
}

### Get video by id
GET {{baseUrl}}/videos/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Publish video (requires at least one VideoSource — i.e. MediaService must have finished processing first)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/videos/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/publish
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "visibility": "Public"
}

### Get video feed
GET {{baseUrl}}/videos/feed?page=1&pageSize=20

### Delete video
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/videos/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### React to video (like)
POST {{baseUrl}}/videos/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/react
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "type": "Like"
}

### React to video (dislike)
POST {{baseUrl}}/videos/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/react
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "type": "Dislike"
}

### Add comment
POST {{baseUrl}}/videos/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/comments
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "text": "Great video!"
}

### Delete comment
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/comments/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Recommendations — contextual (related to a specific video)
GET {{baseUrl}}/recommendations?videoId=00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000&limit=10

### Recommendations — personalized (based on caller's like history)
GET {{baseUrl}}/recommendations?limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Recommendations — anonymous fallback (popular videos)
GET {{baseUrl}}/recommendations?limit=10

### Search — full text
GET {{baseUrl}}/videos/search?q=tutorial&page=1&pageSize=20

### Search — with tag filter (comma-separated; note: tag filtering not yet wired in query DSL, see earlier flag)
GET {{baseUrl}}/videos/search?q=dotnet&tags=tech,tutorial&page=1&pageSize=20